        "margin of significance is small: 0.561 vs. ±0.529 threshold",
        "no other instrument pair shows analogous peak correlation",
        "no independent confirmation from colleague observations"
      ],
      "evidenceAgainst": [
        "resonator_lab ↔ resonator_obs does marginally exceed threshold, not fall within it"
      ]
